<title>UK: Laura Ashley set to warn on profits-paper.</title>
<headline>Laura Ashley set to warn on profits-paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>British fashion and textiles group Laura Ashley Holdings Plc is expected to issue a profits warning this week, the Daily Telegraph said on Monday.</p>
<p>The newspaper said the trading statement, which follows on from a profit warning in April, would be made a month before the company was due to unveil interim results.</p>
<p>The company was also expected to announce a temporary halt to its expansion in the U.S., said the newspaper.</p>
